  "historyNote": "#6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04 New. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13 New. #10812, eff 4-18-15; ss by #13388, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-25-22, EXPIRED 11-21-22, and #10812 effective again pursuant to RSA 541-A:18, V",
